  "steps": [
    "Fry the garlic and ginger in olive oil, add the chopped pepper and brown well.",
    "Add the dry spices and stir for a few minutes, then add the rice and 2 cups of hot water. Season with salt and cook.",
    "When the rice is almost dry, add the chickpeas with the coconut milk and 200 ml water and let it come together for a few minutes.",
    "Finish with lemon and coriander.",
    "Onions: cook the onions in the oil, stirring patiently, until deeply caramelised and reduced. Salt at the end and pile on top of the rice."
  ],
  "notes": "Makes a big batch that freezes well."
